        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eki n'ekigambo ekyaizire ahari Yeremia nikiruga ahari MUKAMA, obu Nebuzaradaani omukuru w'abarinzi yaabaire aherize kumurekura kuruga Raama, naamutwara abohirwe n'enjegyere hamwe n'ezindi nkwatwa zoona eza Yerusaalemu na Yuda, ezaabaire nizitwarwa Babulooni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.29.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bir 29:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.29.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omukuru w'abarinzi yaatwara Yeremia, yaamugira ati: MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe akagamba akabi aka akarihika aha mwanya ogu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.9.10+DAN.9.11+DAN.9.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 9:10-12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " MUKAMA akihikiriize, yaakora nk'oku yaagambire. Ebi byona bibahikireho ahabw'okuba mukacumura ahari MUKAMA, mwayanga kuhurira eiraka rye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.39.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 39:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mbwenu eri izooba naaza kukwiha enjegyere aha mikono. Ku oraabe noosiima kugyenda naanye Babulooni, ija, naanye niinyija kukurinda gye. Kwonka ku oraabe otarikusiima kugyenda naanye Babulooni, orereere. Reeba, ensi yoona eri omu maisho gaawe; za ahu orikwenda hoona, ah'orikuteekateeka ngu ni harungi kandi hahikire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku oraatsigare, ogarukye ahari Gedalia mwene Ahikaamu, mwijukuru wa Shafani, ou omugabe wa Babulooni ataireho kutegyeka endembo za Yuda, otuure nawe omu bantu; nari shi oze ahu orikusiima hoona. Atyo omukuru w'abarinzi yaamuha entanda n'ekiconco, yaamureka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.41.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 41:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima Yeremia yaagyenda yaashanga Gedalia mwene Ahikamu Mizipa, yaatuura nawe omu bantu abaabaire batsigaire omu nsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
