            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima abakuru b'engabo boona abaabaire bari omu bwerere, bo n'abantu baabo, ku baahuriire ngu omugabe wa Babulooni agizire Gedalia mwene Ahikaamu omutegyeki omuri egyo nsi, kandi ngu amukwatsize abashaija, abakazi n'abaana abarikukira abandi boona kuba abooro, abaabaire batatwairwe Babulooni omu bukwatwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
