                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " baaza Mizipa owa Gedalia, amaziina gaabo nigo aga, Ishimaeli mwene Nesania, Yohanaani mwenge Karea, Seraaya mwene Tanihumeesi, beene Efai aba Netofa, na Yezania mutabani w'Omunyamaaka, bo n'abashaija baabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gedalia mwene Ahikaamu mwijukuru wa Shafani yaabarahira, bo n'abashaija baabo, yaabagira ati: Murekye kutiina kwehongyera Abakaludaaya. Mugume omu nsi egi, nimuheereza omugabe wa Babulooni; obwo nibwo muraije kuguma muri gye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.52.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 52:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.1.38"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bir 1:38",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nyowe niinyija kuguma Mizipa nimbatabaarira aha Bakaludaaya abariija owaitu; kwonka imwe mugume mushanguruze viinyo n'ebijuma by'omu kyanda n'amajuta, mubibiikye omu nyungu zaanyu, mutuure omu ndembo ezi mukubwire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'Abayuda boona abaabaire batwire Moabu n'omu Baamoni n'omuri Edomu n'omu nsi ezindi zoona, ku bahuriire ngu omugabe wa Babulooni atsigireyo abaahonokire aha Bayuda, yaataho Gedalia mwene Ahikaamu mwijukuru wa Shafani kuba omutegyeki waabo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.43.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 43:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Abayudaaya abo boona baagaruka, baaruga ei baabaire babingiirwe yoona, baija Mizipa owa Gedalia omu nsi ya Yuda; baashanguruza viinyo n'ebijuma by'omu kyanda bingi munonga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.12"
            ]
          }
        }
