            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima Yohanaani mwene Karea n'abakuru b'engabo abaabaire bari omu nsi y'obwerere, baija Mizipa hari Gedalia, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.41.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 41:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " baamugira bati: Torikumanya ku Baalisi omugabe w'Abaamoni ayohereize Ishimaeli mwene Nesania kukwita? Kwonka Gedalia mwene Ahikaamu tiyaabaikiriza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima Yohanaani mwene Karea yaagambirira Gedalia Mizipa omu mubonano, ati: Ninkushaba, ondekye nze kwita Ishimaeli mwene Nesania, kandi tihariho orikwija kukimanya. Mbwenu, ku yaakukwita, Abayudaaya boona abaakuteeraniireho baataataana, n'abahonokire aha Bayuda baahwerekyerera, okaazira ki? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwonka Gedalia mwene Ahikaamu yaagira Yohanaani mwene Karea ati: Otakora ekyo kintu, ahabw'okuba noobeiherera Ishimaeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
